\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dlr Weaker Midday As Mkt Tests  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Level \b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 05:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is weaker midday Wednesday as overseas hedge funds test whether the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be adjusting its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate in line with an upcoming change in a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  convertibility agreement with banks. \par \par \uc2  Around 0321 GMT (10:21 p.m. Tuesday EST), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7494 to the U.S. dollar, weaker than HK$7.7489 late Tuesday, and very close to the HK$7.75 level at which the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will step into markets to cool down the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  Traders said some market players, led by overseas hedge funds, want to keep the spot rate near the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level to see if the HKMA moves it in step with the gradual movement in the convertibility rate. \par \par \uc2  In a measure to strengthen the Hong Kong dollar's peg to the U.S. dollar, the HKMA announced last year it would move the rate at which it guarantees U.S. dollar conversion to banks from its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of HK$7.75 to the peg rate of HK$7.800 in small steps over 500 days. But the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been less clear on whether it would make matching daily moves of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  In the first few hours of trading Wednesday, market participants sold HK$775 million for U.S. dollars, which also put pressure on short-term interbank rates. The overnight Hong Kong Interbank rate is quoted at 6% from 5.25% late Tuesday. But the pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is mostly confined to the spot market and short-term forwards, said a trader at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The one-month forward premium is quoted at 43 points, up from 42 points late Tuesday, while the three-month and six-month premiums are flat at 140 and 430 points, respectively. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 31-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0339GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3v02hdo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
