\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Steady Near Midday In Thin Pre-Holiday Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Februar 1999\par 04:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is steady late morning Monday, with most banks and corporates squared up and sidelined for Chinese New Year. \par \par \uc2  Around 0312 GMT (10:12 p.m. EST Sunday), the Hong Kong dollar is quoted at HK$7.7498 against the U.S. dollar, unchanged from late Friday. The Hong Kong dollar has only traded at HK$7.7497 and HK$7.7498 so far Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The market's almost shut down ahead of Chinese New Year," a dealer with an Australian bank said. The territory's stock market is due to close at 0430 GMT (11:30 p.m. EST Sunday) Monday and will be closed for the next three days, reopening for business as usual Friday. \par \par \uc2  A treasurer with a local bank said there's been very little trading interest, apart from in the forwards. "This morning we heard there was buying interest in the six month (forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market), but it was a small size and the market's unchanged," he said. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a British bank said he heard that a U.S. institution late Friday unsuccessfully tried to push the spot Hong Kong dollar through HK$7.7500, seen as a trigger point for \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the one-month premium is quoted at 95 points, up from 90 points late Friday. The three-month premium is quoted at 275 points, down from 290 points. The six-month premium is quoted at 780 points, down from 800. The one-year premium is quoted at 2000, unchanged from late Friday. \par \par \uc2  -By Sean Kennedy; (852) 2832 2336; sean.kennedy@cor.dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0344GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2f016r4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
