\par\par \b \uc2  HKMA Chief Says Hedge Funds In Retreat; After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1998\par 04:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said hedge funds are in retreat after it took them on in the stock and futures market to defend its local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We have seen substantial unwinding of the short positions in our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the hedge funds, with considerable losses," Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chief Executive Joseph Yam said in a statement released late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "And with the stock market having recovered substantially from the level at which we entered the market in the middle of August, more considerable losses were incurred also in their short positions in the stock index futures," he added, defending the HKMA's August \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stock and futures markets. \par \par \uc2  "Free markets don't mean that markets can be freely manipulated. They need to be fair markets as well. We've a responsibility to tackle market manipulation and avoid serious market dislocations developing," Yam said. \par \par \uc2  Yam said the hedge funds had lined up Hong Kong dollars in advance of their attack, so that they wouldn't be hit by penal local interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "This they did by swapping U.S. dollars for Hong Kong dollars..., incurring an interest cost of HK$4.0 million a day for the HK$30 billion position. But this wasn't a lot of money to them," Yam said. \par \par \uc2  "We had reason to believe that they had been building up and maintaining quite large short positions in the stock index futures," Yam said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 15-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0256GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920duaf007x2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
