\par\par \b \uc2  HK Mkt Action Confusing, Affects Argentina Peso - Analyst \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 1998\par 17:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--The sustainability of Argentina's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board depends greatly on the ability of Hong Kong authorities to hold the line on theirs, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  government's recent market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was confusing and unorthodox, a prominent Argentine analyst said Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board in Argentina is affected by the Hong Kong situation. Maybe we study Hong Kong more than anybody in the world," said Ricardo Lopez-Murphy, head of Argentina's Foundation for Latin American Economic Research. \par \par \uc2  Late in August, the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought billions of U.S. dollars worth of local stocks and futures in order to break what it said was a "double-play" action by speculators to attack the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  Lopez-Murphy said he can't see Argentine authorities taking a similar action to defend the country's peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . For one thing, he said speculators would be hard-pressed to profit from what they were apparently doing in Hong Kong: selling stocks, futures and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  concurrently to profit from short positions. \par \par \uc2  The bigger size of Hong Kong's capital markets in relation to those of Argentina is an important difference, he said. \par \par \uc2  "For us, it was difficult to understand why they were buying shares," Lopez-Murphy said, adding that Hong Kong's action wasn't "orthodox" in terms of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 05-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1535GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dua5000dj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
