\par\par \b \uc2  HK democrats say rules key in foiling speculators. \b0\par\par\uc2 468 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 1998\par 13:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, Sept 28 (Reuters) - Tighter regulation in \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  is more effective than \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foiling speculative attacks against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Democratic Party said in a news briefing on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Albert Ho, a spokesman for the legislature's single largest party, said concern about speculative activities by hedge funds and the recent troubles of U.S. hedge fund Long Term Capital Management should not lead to the conclusion that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the correct solution. \par \par \uc2  Prudent regulation was more effective, he said. \par \par \uc2  "Regulation as a preventive measure should of course be adopted instead of direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the stock market and exchange market using speculation to counter speculation," Ho said. \par \par \uc2  "Direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be wrong. Even the government has acknowledged that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was very costly," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the stock and futures exhanges in August to foil speculators it said had attacked the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg with the aim of pushing interest rates up and share prices down to take profits on short stock positions. \par \par \uc2  Under Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system, pressures for a weak Hong Kong dollar automatically cause interest rates to rise and vice versa. \par \par \uc2  Compelling hedge funds to conform to rules and operate more transparently and regulating short selling were possible solutions to deter speculative attacks, said Ho. \par \par \uc2  The party called on the HKMA to exercise a rule-based and more transparent governing system to strengthen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board, rather than rely on its own discretion. \par \par \uc2  "My conclusion is that the HKMA was too overconfident in its wisdom in exercising its administrative discretion...The HKMA was reluctant to introduce a rule-based system policy so as to increase the transparency of the system to fortify the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board and constrain speculators," he said. \par \par \uc2  He criticised HKMA chief executive Joseph Yam for having too much power, saying the HKMA was operating more like a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  than a defender of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board. \par \par \uc2  "The chief executive has extensive power, from setting up the Liquidity Adjustment Facility, issuing bonds and establishing the Mortgage Corporation to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the markets using huge billions of dollars from the reserve fund," said Ho. \par \par \uc2  The party suggested the power of the HKMA be clearly defined by ordinance. It said the chief executive should have a set term of office and should be openly accountable. \par \par \uc2  The party said it viewed the seven-point plan announced by the HKMA in early September to strengthen the peg system as being a step closer to a pure \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system. \par \par \uc2  While the authority's discount window was irrelevant to maintaining a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system, it was widely accepted by the market, the party said. \par \par \uc2  - Angi Li (852) 2847 4039; Fax (852) 2845 0636. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021108du9s021gl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
