n exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 05-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0405GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9507m8p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
